{"id":"n72139-1-8","stage":1,"title":"출근 · 上班","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72139-1-8-1","ko":"휴가 때 뭐 하실 계획이세요?","zh":"休假时有什么计划？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"하실","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하실","audio":"/audio/d193919346028a46481b.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이세요?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이세요","audio":"/audio/0b20910c1b281ac477c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/f6ffe709b0d2491fa4d3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72139-1-8-2","ko":"오랜만에 출근도 안 하니 집에서 실컷 잠이나 자려고요.","zh":"难得不用上班，打算在家睡个够。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"출근도","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근：上班；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"출근","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72139","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출근도","audio":"/audio/1d5663bbfa978a394626.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"실컷","meaning":"尽情，充分","explanation":"실컷：尽情，充分","readings":[{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14126","senseId":"1","lemma":"실컷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실컷","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3"}},{"text":"잠이나","meaning":"觉，睡眠","explanation":"잠：觉，睡眠；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"잠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70078","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠이나","audio":"/audio/171820e295428f7e8ef1.mp3"}},{"text":"자려고요.","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자려고요","audio":"/audio/7a1837c53e95a0f89989.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"0ece90941e0c8568","term":"출근","zh":"上班","audio":"/audio/0ece90941e0c8568c6d5.mp3","entryId":"72139","definition":"去单位工作。","pronunciation":["출근"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"5f58ab67054aac9b","term":"실컷","zh":"尽情，充分","audio":"/audio/5f58ab67054aac9b5043.mp3","entryId":"14126","definition":"想做什么就做什么。","pronunciation":["실컫"]},{"id":"699e97260979403d","term":"잠","zh":"觉，睡眠","audio":"/audio/699e97260979403d2584.mp3","entryId":"70078","definition":"指闭上眼睛，停止身体、精神活动而休息一会儿的状态。","pronunciation":["잠"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b17c6192d2d1992c7beb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.568,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72139","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0815,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["休假时有什么计划？","难得不用上班，打算在家睡个够。","你最晚什么时候能到约定地点？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["休假时有什么计划？","难得不用上班，打算在家睡个够。","你最晚什么时候能到约定地点？"],"answer":1}]}
